<p>Dear <%= @contact.first_name %>,</p>
<p>We're very sorry for your loss. <%= @fellow.display_name %> chose you to receive their Sondage recordings.</p>
<p>Here is what to do. Take your time, and call us if you'd like help.</p>
<ol>
  <% if @new_account %>
    <li>We've sent you a separate email to set a password for your Sondage account.</li>
  <% else %>
    <li>Use the Sondage account you already have (this email address).</li>
  <% end %>
  <li>Install the Sondage app on your computer: <a href="<%= download_url %>">get the app</a>.</li>
  <li>Copy the folder with <%= @fellow.display_name.split.first %>'s recordings from their computer (it's called "Sondage" in their Documents folder) or from a backup.</li>
  <li>Open the app, sign in, and press "Ask for the key". Then click the button in the safety email you keep for <%= @fellow.display_name.split.first %>.</li>
</ol>
<p>For safety, Sondage releases its part of the key from <%= @claim.release_after.strftime("%B %-d, %Y") %>, after a short call with you.</p>
